            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "東京11月核心通脹升至2.9% 創16個月新高",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">日本總務省周五公布的初步數據顯示，東京11月核心消費物價按年上升2.9%，升幅為16個月以來最大，進一步反映日本首都家庭正面對日益沉重的生活成本壓力。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">升幅較10月的2.6%加快，主要受中東緊張局勢推高能源成本、日圓疲弱導致進口價格上漲，以及企業將更高開支轉嫁消費者所帶動。</p>\n<!-- slider begin -->\n<div class=\"fancy-slider\">\n<p class=\"fancy-gallery-tips\" style=\"font-weight: bold;font-size: 18px; margin: 0\">點擊看圖輯</p>\n<div class=\"fancy-main\">\n<div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510360_04.jpeg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510360_04.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510360_06.jpeg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510360_06.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\"></h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510360_02.jpeg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510360_02.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510360_03.jpeg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510360_03.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1138x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510360_01.jpeg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1138x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510360_01.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fancy-main__controls\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__controls-text bpcategory-special-color\">更多相片</div>\n<div class=\"fancy-main__buttons\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__button __prev fancy-main-prev\" style=\"border-right: 8px solid #996600\"></div>\n<div class=\"rule\"></div>\n<div class=\"fancy-main__button __next fancy-main-next\" style=\"border-left: 8px solid #996600\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs\">\n<div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510360_04.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510360_06.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\"></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510360_02.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510360_03.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1138x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510360_01.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- slider end -->\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">調查的10個主要類別中，有9個的價格按年上升。在包括電力、燃氣及供水的公用事業類別中，電費急升9.5%，城市燃氣費用飆升13.7%，煤油價格上升15.5%。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">核心消費物價指數剔除波動較大的新鮮食品項目。東京的數據被視為全國趨勢的指標。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">通脹率連續第三個月高於日本央行2%的物價穩定目標，令市場對央行加息的預期持續。日本央行已暗示，在通脹超標風險日益增加下，將從目前的1.25%進一步上調利率，並會在12月17日及18日舉行的下一次政策會議上提高關鍵利率。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">全國11月消費物價指數數據定於12月18日公布。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">（CGTN）</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510360_04.jpeg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510360_04.jpeg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</p>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510360_06.jpeg.webp\">\n<img src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510360_06.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</a>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510360_02.jpeg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510360_02.jpeg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</p>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510360_03.jpeg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510360_03.jpeg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</p>\n</a>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1138x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510360_01.jpeg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1138x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510360_01.jpeg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size