olid #996600\"></div>\n<div class=\"rule\"></div>\n<div class=\"fancy-main__button __next fancy-main-next\" style=\"border-left: 8px solid #996600\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs\">\n<div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510304_04.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510304_05.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510304_06.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510304_02.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510304_03.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1138x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510304_01.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- slider end -->\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">背面圖案則每枚不同。10公斤圓形金幣以羊群配以太陽、山、水及草原的組合設計，並刊「丁未」字樣及面額。「丁未」為中國干支紀年，代表2027年。1公斤梅花形金幣以羊配以草原、山及雲的設計，同樣刊有「丁未」字樣及面額。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">500克圓形金幣以風格化羊設計，150克圓形金幣以風格化羊頭設計。15克梅花形金幣則以母羊與小羊的卡通設計。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">中國人民銀行自1981年起每年發行生肖主題貴金屬紀念幣，使生肖系列成為中國發行最早、品種最豐富、收藏最廣泛的紀念幣系列。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">（CGTN）</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510304_04.jpeg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510304_04.jpeg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</p>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510304_05.jpeg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510304_05.jpeg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</p>\n</a>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8510304_06.jpeg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_85103